    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERAL</h2><br><strong>WAR ON THE STREET</strong> is a top-down shooter game in which you have to fight a group of terrorists occupying the streets of Zamir.<br> <br>You are <i>Special Agent N</i>, who has excellent physical and psychological training, excellent handling of any kind of weapon. Your superiors sent you to the city to conduct a special anti-terrorist operation, clear the city of terrorists and get out of there alive, this will help you numerous arsenal of weapons scattered around the city.<br><br><strong>Incredible Atmosphere</strong>, <strong>Great Music</strong>, <strong>lots of fun with lots of weapons.</strong><br>The game is great for relaxing after a hard day.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Variety of weapons</strong><br></li><li><strong>Beautiful animations</strong><br></li><li><strong>Nice lowpoly graphics</strong><br></li><li><strong>Relaxing and fun gameplay</strong><br></li><li><strong>Pleasant atmosphere.</strong></li></ul>",
